/* Advance the AI attack state machine.
 * ai_state: pointer to AIState (tracks phase timer and sub-phase)
 * battle_obj: pointer to the acting BattleObject (alliance, extra vars)
 * attack_vars: pointer to AIAttackVars (output buffer for the chosen attack)
 *
