 * the records whose id halfword (offset 0) is nonzero and tallies those ids
 * into a zero-filled table at unk_20343E0 of {u16 id, u16 count} slots.
 * Pass 2 revisits every record whose tally halfword (offset 0x14) is nonzero,
 * looks the id up in the tally table and stores count<<16 | id back into the
 * record's 32-bit field at +0x14.
